  "html": "<h1>Quote Category Keys</h1>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"quote\">quote</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>quote</code> category control the arrangement and style of quote blocks.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 23.0769%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 30.7692%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 46.1539%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">background-color</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"color.html\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  background-color: #757575</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-color</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-color\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <code>'EEEEEE'</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  border-color: #E6E8FA</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#border-width\">border-left-width</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-width\">Measurement</a><br>\n(default: <code>4</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  border-left-width: 5</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-radius</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#radius\">Measurement</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  border-radius: 4</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-style</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-style\">Border style</a><br>\n(default: <code>solid</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  border-style: dotted</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#border-width\">border-width</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-width\">Measurement</a> | <a href=\"blocks.html#border-width\">Measurement[]</a><br>\n(default: <code>0</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  border-width: 0.5</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-color</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"color.html\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  font-color: #333333</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-family</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"font-support.html\">Font family name</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  font-family: Noto Serif</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-kerning</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><code>none</code> | <code>normal</code><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  font-kerning: none</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-size</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-size\">Font size</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  font-size: 13</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-style</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-style\">Font style</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  font-style: bold</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">padding</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#padding\">Measurement</a> | <a href=\"blocks.html#padding\">Measurement[]</a><br>\n(default: <code>[3, 12, 3, 14]</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  padding: [3, 0, 3, 20]</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">text-transform</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#transform\">Text transform</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  text-transform: uppercase</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"border-width\">border-width and border-left-width</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>If the value assigned to the <code>border-left-width</code> key is non-zero, the border is only applied to the left side of the quote block.\nOtherwise, if the value assigned to the <code>border-width</code> key is non-zero, the border is drawn around the whole quote block.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"quote-cite\">quote-cite</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>quote-cite</code> category control the arrangement and style of the citation in quote blocks.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 23.0769%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 30.7692%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 46.1539%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-color</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"color.html\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    font-color: #999999</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-family</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"font-support.html\">Font family name</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    font-family: Noto Serif</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-kerning</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><code>none</code> | <code>normal</code><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    font-kerning: none</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-size</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-size\">Font size</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    font-size: 9</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-style</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-style\">Font style</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    font-style: bold</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">text-transform</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#transform\">Text transform</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">quote:\n  cite:\n    text-transform: smallcaps</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
}
